.chrome-profile/
.design-references/

# Archify (tt-a1i/archify) dev-tooling skill: vendored copy is machine-local, matching
# the existing skills-lock.json pattern for third-party skills (not vendored in-repo).
# Reinstall with a pinned-commit copy or `npx skills add tt-a1i/archify`; see
# docs/releases/ARCHIFY-INTEGRATION-REPORT.md.
/.claude/skills/archify/
# Generated diagrams are reproducible from their candidate.json + the pinned repo
# revision; keep candidate.json only for diagrams the team wants to preserve, and
# regenerate the HTML rather than committing working output.
/.archify/
